          Singleton, M.J., E.L. Sonnenthal, M.E. Conrad, D.J, DePaolo, and G.W. Gee, Multiphase reactive transport 
     modeling of stable isotope fractionation in unsaturated zone pore water and vapor:  Application to seasonal 
